# No helper copy

## Hard rule
**Do not add 보조설명** — helper text, hint lines, subtitle blurbs, or “how to use” paragraphs.

Controls carry their own meaning. A title, field label, button label, and cost chip are enough.

## Allowed
- Modal / section **title**
- Control **label** (e.g. Nickname)
- **Button** text
- **Price / cost** on the action (icon + number, or Free)

## Disallowed
```html
<p class="settings-account">Pick an unlocked Codex icon.</p>
<span class="settings-lang-hint">First rename is free</span>
<small>2–6 Hangul characters</small>
```

Standing format hints, empty-state essays, and extra sentences under a title are helper copy. Show errors only after a failed action (inline on the sheet), not as always-visible instructions. Do not use toasts.

## Checklist
1. New sheet has title + controls + actions — no hint paragraph.
2. Cost belongs on the button, not in a footnote.
3. Do not add `*Hint` / `*Blurb` i18n keys unless the user asked for that sentence.
